# Cursor agent workflow

Before substantial edits, run:

```bash
git status --short
git branch --show-current
```

Leave unrelated dirty files alone.

## Roles (non-trivial tasks)

1. Planner — scope + smallest safe plan
2. Backend — FastAPI routes/services/agents/tests
3. Frontend — React UI, `api.js`, Simple/Developer Mode, EA theme
4. Security/Governance — secrets, protected paths, unsafe commands
5. Testing — focused then full backend pytest / frontend build
6. Reviewer — diff hygiene before commit

Tiny docs/one-line fixes: Planner + Reviewer only.

## Never edit or stage

`.env`, `backend/.env`, `.git/`, `node_modules/`, `venv/`, `__pycache__/`, `backend/app/data/`, `backend/app/uploads/`, `frontend/dist/`, logs/cache.

## Forbidden unless user explicitly asks

`git reset --hard`, `git checkout -- .`, `rm -rf`, force push, auth/payments/Docker/migrations/vector DB/unrestricted shell/real external integrations.

## Verify

```bash
cd backend && ./venv/bin/pytest -q
cd frontend && npm run build
```

## Finish report

branch, files changed, commit hash, backend test result, frontend build result, Linear status if updated, limitations/follow-ups.
